  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Copenhagen Gl\u00f8d Index Close No. Section 01 Home 02 Menus 03 Events 04 Private dining 05 Story No. Section 06 Journal 07 Gift cards 08 Visit 09 Book a table 10 All pages Find us J\u00e6gersborggade 41, 2200 K\u00f8benhavn N Open Wednesday to Saturday, 17:30 to 23:00 Talk to us [email protected] +00 00 00 00 00 masterclass Bread at the fire Rye and sourdough with our baker, Elin S\u00f8rensen. Book a seat Book a seat Read more Read more When Thursday 19 November, 18:00 Price 550 kr Seats 12 in total Kind Masterclass The evening Elin has baked our bread every morning since we opened. For one evening she shows twelve people how she does it, from feeding the starter to pulling a loaf out of the wood oven. You mix and shape your own rye, eat supper at the counter while it bakes, and take the loaf home with a jar of our starter. How it works The class runs from 18:00 to about 21:30. Supper and a glass of wine are included. Wear something you do not mind getting flour on. 550 kr. Tell us about allergies when you book. Book a seat Book a seat Also coming up All events All events 01 08.10 Harvest dinner wine dinner, Thursday19:00 02 18.10 Long Sunday lunch supper club, Sunday12:30 03 04.12 ",
